WEBVTT

00:13:28.331 --> 00:13:30.522
Njima se ovo dogodilo.

00:13:30.546 --> 00:13:32.383
Ali ne mora da se dogodi nama.

00:13:32.407 --> 00:13:35.577
Razlika između dinosaurusa i nas

00:13:35.601 --> 00:13:37.689
je da mi imamo svemirski program

00:13:37.713 --> 00:13:39.459
i mi možemo da glasamo,

00:13:39.483 --> 00:13:41.967
i možemo da promenimo našu budućnost.

00:13:41.991 --> 00:13:43.443
(Smeh)

00:13:43.467 --> 00:13:45.540
Mi imamo sposobnost
da promenimo budućnost.

00:13:45.564 --> 00:13:47.524
Kroz 65 miliona godina

00:13:47.548 --> 00:13:51.474
naše kosti ne moraju
da skupljaju prašinu u muzeju.

00:13:51.498 --> 00:13:52.809
Mnogo vam hvala.

00:13:52.833 --> 00:13:55.761
(Aplauz)